{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gwkcZcH8Tf1794812170.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產禮頓道分行B組高級資深分區營業經理黃健忠表示，分行新近促成跑馬地The Aster租賃成交，單位為平台特色戶，實用面積579平方呎，採2房間隔，連約593平方呎特大平台，向北，望樓景。單位最新以4.4萬元租出，折合實用呎租76元。<br/>黃健忠表示，新租客為外區客，心儀跑馬地環境清幽，物業設有會所設施，而且單位擁私人平台，遂決定承租。據了解，業主於2024年以1,711萬元購入單位，持貨2年，是次出租可享逾3厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:30:51.779562+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T00:15:54.133076+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:13.407127+00:00","content_hash":"7843d86309971f93310355e1f689601e6412c07b32c642dd93f7a00c37ca6482","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:30:51.779562+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}